{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repel the Rifts</strong> is a roguelite tower defense game set on an alien world. As a Commander of a mining expedition gone awry, you must defend against relentless waves of inter-dimensional creatures emerging from mysterious rifts. Survive the nights, survey further into the unknown and track down the source of these rifts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survey the Unknown</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/3986a52574f4c10abd4e0882ec7fef95.poster.avif?t=1759935297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/3986a52574f4c10abd4e0882ec7fef95.webm?t=1759935297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/3986a52574f4c10abd4e0882ec7fef95.mp4?t=1759935297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survey the unknown to expand the map. Different towers can benefit from different geography, so choose carefully Commander!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your Towers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/9f3153a2f3959816e0d6ef0bfbe55223.poster.avif?t=1759935297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/9f3153a2f3959816e0d6ef0bfbe55223.webm?t=1759935297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/9f3153a2f3959816e0d6ef0bfbe55223.mp4?t=1759935297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase tower upgrades from a market that strengthen your towers and can even grant new effects. Discover different combinations and strategies every expedition!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover alien Artifacts</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/3614bad2a89de55532d4cbe017db0e55.poster.avif?t=1759935297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/3614bad2a89de55532d4cbe017db0e55.webm?t=1759935297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/3614bad2a89de55532d4cbe017db0e55.mp4?t=1759935297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Collect powerful artifacts to augment your defense. Finding the right combinations can take your defenses to the next level!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Commander Selection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/5261fd32cfa4190b9e8d8b792a5bdc80.poster.avif?t=1759935297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/5261fd32cfa4190b9e8d8b792a5bdc80.webm?t=1759935297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/5261fd32cfa4190b9e8d8b792a5bdc80.mp4?t=1759935297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 